pf.quest.chapter.ae2.advanced_ae.quantum:
The quantum computer is a special kind of crafting computer.

It is capable of running an unlimited amount of crafting requests, as long as it has enough crafting storage.

To create a multiblock quantum computer, some rules must be followed:

- The maximum size is 7x7x7 (external dimensions);

- No empty spaces can be present inside the multiblock.
   They can be filled with Quantum Unit for no additional benefits;

- Exactly one Quantum Core;

- At most one Quantum Data Entangler;

- At most one Quantum Multi-threader;

- All blocks on the outside layer must be Quantum Structure;

- No block on the inside can be Quantum Structure.
